NOTE: The data set WORK.LOGASDATA has 138 observations and 3 variables.

30633      ;
30634      ods graphics on;
30635      proc variogram data=logAsData plots=pairs(mid);
30636      compute novariogram nhc=50;
30637      coord xc=East yc=North;
30638      var logAs;
30639      run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed page 1897.

30640      proc variogram data=logAsData plots(only)=semivar;
30641      compute lagd=5 maxlag=40;
30642      coord xc=East yc=North;
30643      var logAs;
30644      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1898-1899.

30645      proc variogram data=logAsData plots(only)=fit;
30646      store out=SemivAsStore / label='LogAs Concentration Models';
30647      compute lagd=5 maxlag=40;
30648      coord xc=East yc=North;
30649      model form=auto(mlist=(exp,gau,mat) nest=1 to 2);
30650      var logAs;
30651      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
